span {  font-family: Calibri;  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}p.docx_21 span {  font-family: Calibri;  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">各位本科生、各教学单位：</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2025</span><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体; min-height: 20pt; font-size: 20pt;">~</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2026学年国际创新实践周选课工作于6月23日开始，现将有关事宜通知如下:</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">一、选课模式</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">本年度国际创新实践周开设三类课程，具体为</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">海外课程</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">39</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">门次、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">企业课程47门次、通识选修课</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">14</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">4</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">门次，总计</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">30</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">门次。</span><span id="_GoBack"></span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">此次</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">选课</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">分</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">“正选”“补选”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">两个批次进行，面向在籍在校的本科生。选课结束后即生效，学生</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">可</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">实</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">时</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">查看</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">选课结果</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">具体安排如下:</span></p><table class="docx_7" style="width: 410.7pt; table-layout: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><colgroup><col style="width: 48.95pt;"><col style="width: 149.1pt;"><col style="width: 78.2pt;"><col style="width: 134.45pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr class="firstRow" style="text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 0.75pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">批次</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.75pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">选课时间</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.75pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">选课</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">方式</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.75pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">备注</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 53.45pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 0.75pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">正选</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.75pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">23</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">日</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">11</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">:30 </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">开始</span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">月24</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">日</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">:00</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> 截止</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.75pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">即选即得</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.75pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">选课人数少于15人的课程将予以停开。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 54.95pt; text-align: center;"><td style="border-width: 0.75pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">补选</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.75pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">25</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">日</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">:30 </span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">开始</span></p><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">25</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">日</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">17</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">:00</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"> 截止</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.75pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">只选不退</span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0.75pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(62, 62, 62); vertical-align: middle; padding: 0pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">未完成选课或因课程停开落选的学生进行补选。</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">二、选课要求</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> 2025级学生均须选修国际创新实践周课程，其中</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">世界格局类课程</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">每人至少选修1门，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">其他通识选修课</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">每人至少选修1门；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2. 2024、2023级学生根据已修读学分情况自主选修相关课程。2023级学生若有生产实习或其他实习实践任务的，可不参加校内活动。2024级学生在国际创新实践周期间</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">思想政治理论实践课</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">安排三次理论课，请按本人课表按时到课；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">正选批次</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">结束后，教务处会对选课人数不足的课程予以停开，请相关学生及时补选并</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">于选课结束后查看个人课表</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">三、课程类型等效认定规则</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">依照学校培养方案调整情况，通识教育课程按2024版本开设，2023级学生选修后按照以下规则等效认定： </span></p><table class="docx_7" style="width: 443.45pt; table-layout: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><colgroup><col style="width: 76.3pt;"><col style="width: 106.3pt;"><col style="width: 134.65pt;"><col style="width: 126.2pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr class="firstRow" style="text-align: center;"><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">课程类别</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">2024、2025级学分要求（总≥8学分）</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">认定类别（其它年级学生修读认定类型）</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">备注</span></p></td></tr><tr style="text-align: center;"><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">人文禀赋</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">≥2学分</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">人文社科</span></p></td><td rowspan="5" style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">2023级学生须修读通识教育选修课8学分并覆盖4个模块（人文社科、美育课程、自然科学、国际双创），其中美育课程≥2学分。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="text-align: center;"><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">审美情操</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">≥2学分</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">美育课程</span></p></td><td style="display: none; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td></tr><tr style="text-align: center;"><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">社会责任</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">≥1学分</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">人文社科</span></p></td><td style="display: none; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td></tr><tr style="text-align: center;"><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">科学思维</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">≥1学分</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">自然科学</span></p></td><td style="display: none; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td></tr><tr style="text-align: center;"><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">世界格局</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">≥1学分</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">国际双创</span></p></td><td style="display: none; vertical-align: middle; border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding: 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">四、补充说明</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">国际创新实践周课程</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">严格执行课程考勤制度</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">，根据《西安电子科技大学学籍管理规定》第十六条规定，选课学生无故缺勤2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">%以上，将取消正常考试资格，该课程正考的成绩以不合格记载</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;">2.请各位本科生及时关注教务处主页相关通知，按时选课。<span style="min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">①</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">海外课程课程</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">介绍详见https://jwc.xidian.edu.cn/info/1083/22693.htm；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">②</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">企业课程介绍</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">详见https://ie.xidian.edu.cn/info/1006/5824.htm。</span><span style="min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">③</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">通识选修课</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（校外引进课程）课程介绍详见https://rwxy.xidian.edu.cn/info/1023/17384.htm。其中</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">部分</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">课程有</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">年级、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">专业</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">等条件</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">限制</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">，请仔细查阅课程介绍，避免误选错选</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(12, 12, 12); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">未选课的学生不允许参加教学活动，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(12, 12, 12); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">选课学生不按规定参加教学活动的，一律不做名单删除处理，其成绩作零分处理</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">4.选课网址为：</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">http://xk.xidian.edu.cn</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。选课</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">使用统一身份认证帐号与密码，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">若有</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">遗忘、错误等问题请咨询</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">信息</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">网络技术中心029-88201650。</span><span style="text-indent: 32pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">选课期间如有</span><span style="text-indent: 32pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">问题请咨询相关教学单位（联系方式见附件），本科生院咨询电话：029-81891206</span><span style="text-indent: 32pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">附件：</span></p><p style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">各单位教务老师联系方式</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;本科生院</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 208pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2026年</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">月19日</span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"></span></p></article></section><section class="docx"><article><p class="docx_6" style="line-height: calc(100% + 20pt); text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">附件</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> </span></p><p class="docx_6" style="line-height: calc(100% + 20pt); text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">各单位选课负责老师联系方式</span></p><table align="center" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><colgroup><col style="width: 181.9pt;"><col style="width: 142.25pt;"><col style="width: 94.3pt;"></colgroup><tbody><tr class="firstRow"><td style="border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; padding: 5px 10px;"><p style="line-height: calc(100% + 20pt); text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 11pt; font-size: 11pt;">单位</span></p></td><td style="border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; padding: 5px 10px;"><p style="line-height: calc(100% + 20pt); text-align: center; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 11pt; font-size: 